<div class="inline-cta-container">
  <div class="inline-cta-accent"></div>
  <h2 class="inline-cta-title">
    Want to see what this looks like for your business?
  </h2>
  <p class="inline-cta-text">
    Get a free 5-minute video showing how Expert Insight Sessions can turn your expertise into content that works.
  </p>
  <a
    href="https://burgergelato.com/get-5-min-video?utm_source=blog&utm_medium=inline-cta&utm_campaign=5min-video"
    class="inline-cta-btn"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    Get My Free Video
  </a>
